<title>UK: CRICKET-GLOUCESTERSHIRE V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GLOUCESTERSHIRE V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, England 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final</p>
<p>day of the three-day match between Gloucestershire and Australia</p>
<p>on Thursday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings 249 (S.Waugh 92, M.Waugh 66; J.Lewis</p>
<p>4-89)</p>
<p>Gloucestershire first innings 350 (N.Trainor 121, R.Cunliffe</p>
<p>61; S.Warne 4-97)</p>
<p>Australia second innings (overnight 43-0)</p>
<p>M.Elliott    lbw b Smith	     124</p>
<p>M.Taylor     lbw b Ball		 30</p>
<p>J.Langer     not out		   152</p>
<p>S.Warne	b Smith		     0</p>
<p>J.Gillespie  c Russell b Lewis	 7</p>
<p>M.E.Waugh    not out		    32</p>
<p>Extras (b-6 lb-2 w-1)		    9</p>
<p>Total (four wickets declared)	354</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 1-62 2-254 3-262 4-269</p>
<p>Did not bat: S.Waugh, M.Bevan, I.Healey, M.Kasprowicz,</p>
<p>G.Mcgrath</p>
<p>Bowling: Smith 13-5-18-2, Davis 29-6-101-0, Lewis 18-5-59-1,</p>
<p>Ball 28-9-89-1, Alleyne 8-2-25-0, Trainor 3-2-8-0, Hancock</p>
<p>5-0-26-0, Russell 3-0-15-0, Young 2-0-5-0</p>
<p>Match drawn.</p>
</text>
